EvalSuite[skillName=news-macro-analysis, evals=[Eval[id=1, prompt=Generate a market analysis report for Apple (AAPL) as of 2023-10-25. The FRED API is currently returning 503 errors for all economic indicators, and the Polymarket API is timing out. However, news retrieval for AAPL is successful., expectedOutput=A report containing AAPL news headlines dated on or before 2023-10-25, with explicit sections stating that macroeconomic indicators and prediction market probabilities are unavailable due to data source failures, without aborting the process., files=[], expectations=[The report must include news headlines for AAPL., The report must explicitly state that macroeconomic indicators are unavailable., The report must explicitly state that prediction market probabilities are unavailable., The process must not abort or return an error due to the missing macro or prediction market data., All included news items must have publication dates on or before 2023-10-25.]], Eval[id=2, prompt=Produce a global macro report for 2024-01-15. The news retrieval service fails to connect and returns a connection timeout error. FRED and Polymarket data are available., expectedOutput=An error response or loud failure indication indicating that the core news data could not be retrieved, preventing the generation of a complete report., files=[], expectations=[The system must not generate a final report if news data is missing., The system must explicitly flag the news retrieval failure as a critical error., The system must not silently proceed with only macro and prediction market data.]], Eval[id=3, prompt=Create a trading context report for the S&P 500 as of 2023-09-01. The news feed contains a headline about a major earnings miss published on 2023-09-02, and a macro indicator update published on 2023-08-31., expectedOutput=A report that includes the macro indicator from 2023-08-31 but excludes the earnings miss headline from 2023-09-02, ensuring point-in-time integrity., files=[], expectations=[The report must include the macro indicator dated 2023-08-31., The report must exclude the news headline dated 2023-09-02., The report must reflect only information public on or before 2023-09-01.]], Eval[id=4, prompt=Generate a report for Tesla (TSLA) as of 2024-02-10. Polymarket returns a probability of 65% for a specific regulatory event occurring in March 2024. FRED returns CPI data for January 2024. News includes a tweet from Elon Musk dated 2024-02-09., expectedOutput=A report integrating the TSLA news, the January 2024 CPI data, and the 65% Polymarket probability, all contextualized for the 2024-02-10 analysis date., files=[], expectations=[The report must include the specific Polymarket probability (65%) for the regulatory event., The report must include the CPI data for January 2024., The report must include the Elon Musk tweet dated 2024-02-09., The report must clearly attribute the probability to Polymarket and the CPI to FRED.]]]]
